Hi,

I have a problem related to one of the plots of "small worldness"

The code is the following

ggplot(small.dt.m, aes(x=density, y=value, col=interaction(Group, variable),
                       lty=interaction(Group, variable))) +
  geom_line(size=1.25) +
  scale_linetype_manual(name='Group, type',
                        labels=mylabels.sm,
                        values=rep(1:3, each=2)) +
  scale_color_manual(name='Group, type',
                     labels=mylabels.sm,
                     values=rep(c('red', 'cyan3'), 3)) +
  labs(x='Density', y='Clustering coefficient')

 The problem R displays is that small.dt.m can't be found, neither mylabels.sm <http://mylabels.sm>. I've tried to look to the rest of the code but such variable does not appear and I don't know how to create them.

Regards,

